<title>USA: TABLE - Carnegie Group Inc Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Carnegie Group Inc Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended  Six months ended</p>
<p>					     June 30,	June 30,</p>
<p>				   1997	  1996    1997	1996</p>
<p>	Total revenue	  7,858	6,664  14,990    14,987</p>
<p> Net income			522	  121     910	 804</p>
<p>Earnings per share</p>
<p>  of common stock	     0.08	 0.02    0.13	0.11</p>
<p>Weighted average number of common</p>
<p>  shares outstanding	 6,905	7,182   6,930     7,206</p>
<p>		 (in thousands except share and per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE:  The company said its net income and revenues for the second quarter of 1996 were negatively affected by the renegotiation of a significant fixed-price conntract.</p>
</text>
